# Keep the volley sandbox image build context (B′/D5) lean and reproducible:
# ship source + manifests, never host-built artifacts or run state. node_modules
# and dist are rebuilt in-image (`pnpm install` / `pnpm build`); the rest is
# host-only bookkeeping the in-container builder must not inherit.
**/node_modules
dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.git
.plumbbob
**/.check
.fallow
.firecrawl
**/.volley
**/.volley.bak.*
**/*.worktree
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.env
